ent is in early access and may not be close to a completed product yet. Please set your expectations accordingly. Help the developer by providing constructive detailed feedback so we can all work towards improving this content as it develops.\nThank you!\n\nThe TCGXR is not a game, a set of rules or images, but a framework for leting you experince awesome Trading Card Games such as Grand Archive.\n\nFor your convenience, images can be easily integrated using REST APIs.\n\nCheck out our website: http://www.unicorn-production.com/tcgxr/\n\nIf you have questions, feedback or simply searching for fellow players feel free to join our TCGXR Discord community.\n\nTCGXR is unofficial Fan Content permitted under the Fan Content Policy. Not approved/endorsed by Weebs of the Shore.\nPortions of the materials used are property of Weebs of the Shore. \u00a9Weebs of the Shore LLC.", "short_description": "The Trading Card Game XR (TCGXR) allows you to play any one-on-one card game with your friends without having to be present.\n\nThe TCGXR is not a game, a set of rules or images, but a framework for leting you experince awesome Trading Card Games such as Grand Archive.\n\nFor your convenience, images can be easily integrated using REST APIs."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.unicorn-production.com/tcgxr/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Andreas Mank", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.unicorn-production.com/tcgxr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supporte